r to the curve perpendicular to the vector $j$?\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked.\n\n- **I.** $(-1,-1)$\n- **II.** $(-1,0)$\n- **III.** $(0,1)$\n- **IV.** $(1,-1)$\n- **V.** $(1,1)$" :question/worked-solution "Write the curve as F(x,y)=0. A tangent is (F_y,-F_x); its dot product with the given vector is $2 x - 2 y$. Solving this with the curve equation gives $(-1,-1), (1,1)$, and the tangent is nonzero at each point."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186125192 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "84245283-3cf9-5889-8c42-896a0c8af291" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Points on a Curve at which the Tangent Vector is Perpendicular to a Given Vector"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ce07dfdf-2d2a-50b4-b231-394b5d5d097f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439857} {:answer/id #uuid "85dfbd24-c291-5c08-b3d8-efa72d2bebc9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439858}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ce07dfdf-2d2a-50b4-b231-394b5d5d097f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439857} :answer-field/id #uuid "76b7e8b2-e034-52dd-9da2-5852ff35bd1c" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186440286} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "75afdcde-1b54-58d6-b950-1389a729ce22" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439859} {:answer/id #uuid "ddc181f6-b619-50be-b805-c3f50013f219" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439860}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ddc181f6-b619-50be-b805-c3f50013f219" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439860} :answer-field/id #uuid "32972e40-590f-5893-946b-6bd1c90198c0" :answer-field/key "