 {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "47875e80-b080-5ec4-a93d-445fc72ad0bf" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521791} {:answer/id #uuid "c9b55f41-a1e5-5298-bc1c-4923b387c0d3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521852}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c9b55f41-a1e5-5298-bc1c-4923b387c0d3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521852} :answer-field/id #uuid "f1266a7c-b2e9-54bd-aeaa-5ab051911a08" :answer-field/key "IV" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521872}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "5284e034-941a-5de0-a7ad-3718d5b22f4c" :question/problem "At which points on the curve $8 x y + 3 y^{2}=16 x^{2} + 1024$ is the tangent vector to the curve perpendicular to the vector $j$?\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked.\n\n- **I.** $(-4,-16)$\n- **II.** $(0,16)$\n- **III.** $(2,16)$\n- **IV.** $(4,0)$\n- **V.** $(4,8)$\n- **VI.** $(4,16)$" :question/worked-solution "First, we bring all variables to one side:\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}8 x y + 3 y^{2}&=16 x^{2} + 1024\\\\- 16 x^{2} + 8 x y + 3 y^{2} - 1024&=0\\end{aligned}$$\n\nIf we set $f(x,y)=- 16 x^{2} + 8 x y + 3 y^{2} - 1024$, our curve can be viewed as the level curve $f(x,y)=0.$\n\nA tangent vector to the level curve can be computed as follows:\n\n$$t(x,y)=f_y(x,y)\\,i-f_x(x,y)\\,j$$\n\nSo, we calculate $t(x,y):$\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}t(x,y)&=\\frac{∂}{∂y}(- 16 x^{2} + 8 x y + 3 y^{2} - 1024)\\,i-\\frac{∂}{∂x}(- 16 x^{2} + 8 x y + 3 y^{2} - 1024)\\,j\\\\&=(8 x + 6 y)\\,i-(- 32 x + 8 y)\\,j\\end{aligned}$$\n\nSince our tangent vector needs to be perpendicular to $j$, we must have $t\\cdot j=0.$\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}t(x,y)\\cdot j&=0\\\\32 x - 8 y&=0\\\\y&=4x\\end{aligned}$$\n\nSubstituting $y=4x$ into the equation of our curve gives:\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}3(4x)^{2}+8x(4x)-16x^{2}-1024&=0\\\\64x^{2}-1024&=0\\\\x^{2}&=16\\\\x&=\\pm 4\\end{aligned}$$\n\nFinally, the corresponding points are $(4,16)$ and $(-4,-16)$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186521807 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "84245283-3cf9-5889-8c42-896a0c8af291" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Points on a Curve at which the Tangent Vector is Perpendicular to a Given Vector"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9a081b4b-d2c2-54f6-ab72-e97e24330f29" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521827} {:answer/id #uuid "f122121f-13ed-5d40-84a7-05ee73afda8c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521871}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f122121f-13ed-5d40-84a7-05ee73afda8c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521871} :answer-field/id #uuid "31f0b4d9-85ff-5f7b-a017-2aaa76c4d97a" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521780} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "51d1e0d8-489d-5f8d-ac1f-733085c67b07" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521798} {:answer/id #uuid "81ff8521-700c-5ba4-8fe0-3eb4a044c6cb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521821}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "51d1e0d8-489d-5f8d-ac1f-733085c67b07" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521798} :answer-field/id #uuid "5ea2cb71-3f95-569a-91de-ff7ff0b18064" :answer-field/key "VI" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521805} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "115aa2f4-a593-5d77-a880-a7ebe30e68ff" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "